{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "kind": "vfx-semantic-rules",
  "note": "AI 標註輸入。每條規則都必須列出實際看過的代表圖（evidence）。propagation 決定語意能傳播多遠：evidenceOnly=只給看過的；group=再加上像素簽章證實同形的載體變體；family=同家族其他成員（信心降為 medium）。",
  "libraryId": "effects-materials",
  "rules": [
    {
      "ruleId": "any/pack-preview",
      "select": {
        "namePattern": "^(preview|sample|overview)$",
        "maxDepth": 1,
        "format": "png"
      },
      "evidence": [],
      "propagation": "family",
      "semantics": {
        "kind": "preview"
      },
      "observation": "套件宣傳圖／總覽圖，位於 package 根目錄。依位置＋命名判定，非看圖判定，故信心為 medium"
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "any/vector-source",
      "select": {
        "format": "svg"
      },
      "evidence": [],
      "propagation": "family",
      "semantics": {
        "kind": "nonVfx"
      },
      "observation": "向量原稿，runtime 不能直接使用（需先點陣化），且沒有像素可供判讀形狀；標為 nonVfx 以免被選成貼圖"
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "foliage/sprite",
      "select": {
        "package": "foliage-sprites",
        "namePattern": "^sprite_\\d+$",
        "format": "png"
      },
      "evidence": [
        "foliage-sprites/png/flat/sprite_0001.png"
      ],
      "propagation": "family",
      "semantics": {
        "kind": "nonVfx"
      },
      "observation": "植物剪影，非特效素材；納入索引只為了讓搜尋能明確排除"
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "lightmask/circle",
      "select": {
        "package": "light-masks-1.0",
        "namePattern": "^circle_[a-z](_(noise|streaks|streaks_noise))?$",
        "format": "png"
      },
      "evidence": [
        "light-masks-1.0/default/circle_a_noise.png",
        "light-masks-1.0/default/circle_b.png"
      ],
      "propagation": "family",
      "semantics": {
        "kind": "vfx",
        "shape": "disc",
        "usage": [
          "glow",
          "mask"
        ],
        "element": "neutral",
        "tags": [
          "soft",
          "radial"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "lightmask/circle_rings",
      "select": {
        "package": "light-masks-1.0",
        "namePattern": "^circle_rings_[a-z](_(noise|streaks))?$",
        "format": "png"
      },
      "evidence": [
        "light-masks-1.0/default/circle_rings_a.png"
      ],
      "propagation": "family",
      "semantics": {
        "kind": "vfx",
        "shape": "ring",
        "usage": [
          "ring",
          "glow",
          "impact"
        ],
        "element": "neutral",
        "tags": [
          "radial",
          "layered",
          "symmetric"
        ]
      },
      "observation": "同心多環＋亮心"
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "lightmask/cone_composed",
      "select": {
        "package": "light-masks-1.0",
        "namePattern": "^cone_composed_[a-z](_noise)?$",
        "format": "png"
      },
      "evidence": [
        "light-masks-1.0/default/cone_composed_a.png",
        "light-masks-1.0/default/cone_composed_c_noise.png"
      ],
      "propagation": "family",
      "semantics": {
        "kind": "vfx",
        "shape": "cone",
        "usage": [
          "beam",
          "mask",
          "core"
        ],
        "element": "neutral",
        "tags": [
          "directional",
          "soft"
        ]
      },
      "observation": "上寬下窄的錐狀漸層，可當龍捲／光錐體型"
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "lightmask/cone_plain",
      "select": {
        "package": "light-masks-1.0",
        "namePattern": "^cone_[a-z](_(blur|noise|blur_noise))?$",
        "format": "png"
      },
      "evidence": [
        "light-masks-1.0/default/cone_a.png"
      ],
      "propagation": "family",
      "semantics": {
        "kind": "vfx",
        "shape": "streak",
        "usage": [
          "beam",
          "mask"
        ],
        "element": "neutral",
        "tags": [
          "directional",
          "smooth"
        ]
      },
      "observation": "檔名叫 cone，實際是等寬縱向漸層長條（光柱），與 cone_composed_* 形狀不同，故分成兩條規則"
    },
